<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Box Shadow Examples</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
.example { margin-bottom: 30px; }
.box {
  width: 150px;
  height: 80px;
  background: white;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Box Shadow Step-by-Step</h1>

<div class="example">
  <h2>1. No Shadow</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: none;">No shadow</div>
  <code>box-shadow: none;</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>2. Simple Shadow</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Simple</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>3. Move Shadow (X, Y)</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 10px 10px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Right & Down</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 10px 10px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>4. Blur</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">No blur</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 10px 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Blur</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 10px 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>5. Spread</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 0 0 10px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Spread</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 0 0 10px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>6. Color</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,0,0,0.5);">Red</div>
  <code>box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,0,0,0.5);</code>
</div>

<div class="example">
  <h2>7. Inset Shadow</h2>
  <div class="box" style="box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Inset</div>
  <code>box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);</code>
</div>

</body>
</html>
